activity Identify Risks
activity Develop Continuity Plan
activity Test Continuity Plan
activity Review Test Results
activity Implement Improvements
activity Communicate Plan
activity Monitor Risks
activity Conduct Training
activity Activate Continuity Plan
activity Evaluate Incident Response
bind Identify Risks: Risk Level
bind Develop Continuity Plan: Stakeholder Engagement
bind Test Continuity Plan: Test Outcome
bind Review Test Results: Plan Effectiveness
bind Implement Improvements: Improvement Status
bind Communicate Plan: Communication Method
bind Monitor Risks: Monitoring Frequency
bind Conduct Training: Training Hours
bind Activate Continuity Plan: Incident Severity
bind Evaluate Incident Response: Response Time, Incident Severity
Risk Level: integer between 1 and 10
Plan Effectiveness: float between 0.0 and 100.0
Test Outcome: Pass, Fail
Improvement Status: Completed, Pending
Communication Method: Email, Meeting, Newsletter
Training Hours: integer between 1 and 40
Incident Severity: Low, Medium, High
Response Time: float between 0.0 and 24.0
Stakeholder Engagement: High, Moderate, Low
Monitoring Frequency: integer between 1 and 30
Init[Identify Risks] | |
End[Evaluate Incident Response] | |
Existence[Develop Continuity Plan] | |
Existence[Monitor Risks] | |
Absence[Activate Continuity Plan] |A.Incident Severity is Low |
Exactly2[Test Continuity Plan] | |
Responded Existence[Test Continuity Plan, Implement Improvements] |A.Test Outcome is Fail | |
Precedence[Identify Risks, Develop Continuity Plan] | |A.Risk Level > 5 |
Precedence[Review Test Results, Communicate Plan] | |A.Plan Effectiveness > 70.0 |
Precedence[Conduct Training, Activate Continuity Plan] | |A.Training Hours >= 10 |
Response[Test Continuity Plan, Review Test Results] |A.Test Outcome is Fail | |0,3,d
Response[Review Test Results, Implement Improvements] |A.Plan Effectiveness < 50.0 |T.Improvement Status is Pending |0,7,d
Succession[Identify Risks, Monitor Risks] |A.Risk Level > 7 |T.Monitoring Frequency <= 7 |
Alternate Response[Activate Continuity Plan, Evaluate Incident Response] |A.Incident Severity is High | |
Chain Response[Review Test Results, Communicate Plan] |A.Plan Effectiveness > 90.0 |T.Communication Method is Meeting |
Chain Precedence[Review Test Results, Implement Improvements] | |T.Improvement Status is Completed |
Co-Existence[Conduct Training, Communicate Plan] | | |
Choice[Conduct Training, Communicate Plan] | | |
Not Co-Existence[Activate Continuity Plan, Develop Continuity Plan] |A.Incident Severity is High |T.Improvement Status is Pending |
Not Responded Existence[Monitor Risks, Activate Continuity Plan] |A.Monitoring Frequency > 20 | |
Not Precedence[Develop Continuity Plan, Communicate Plan] | | |
Not Response[Evaluate Incident Response, Activate Continuity Plan] |A.Response Time < 2.0 | |
Not Succession[Implement Improvements, Communicate Plan] |A.Improvement Status is Pending | |
Not Chain Succession[Test Continuity Plan, Communicate Plan] |A.Test Outcome is Fail | |